OL,3,GNEWSAMail deliveries 'down to once a
OL,4,Aweek' in parts of the Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors say household postal
OL,7,Fdeliveries in many parts of the
OL,8,FHighlands have fallen to as little as
OL,9,Fonce a week.
OL,11,FThey said Royal Mail provided a vital
OL,12,Fservice but it had become "infrequent"
OL,13,Fand letters from the NHS, banks and
OL,14,Fsolicitors were arriving late.
OL,16,FThe group of nine councillors want
OL,17,FHighland Council to raise their
OL,18,Fconcerns with Royal Mail bosses.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
