OL,3,GNEWSAMail deliveries 'down to once a
OL,4,Aweek' in parts of the Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company has been approached for
OL,7,Fcomment. It has previously said it
OL,8,Fworked to deliver all items within
OL,9,Ftheir expected time frames.
